            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Discs 4.3

- Add albums with a redesigned search or manual workflow, including a wishlist option.
- Move wishlist albums to your collection with a confirmation and available release date and tracklist.
- Customize your library with refreshed Settings and flat or 3D artwork.
- Browse album notes beside more music from the same artist.
- Enjoy improvements to lyrics navigation, artist profiles, locations, and the first-run tutorial.
]]></description>
