            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Discs 4.2.8

- Give artist profiles a bold new look with edge-to-edge banners, a theme-matched gradient, and a refreshed profile photo editor.
- Limit artist banners and profile photos to 15 MB and 24 megapixels, and save them at up to 2048 pixels.
- Enjoy a clearer Now Playing experience with a fixed-size cover, adaptive location selector, and messages for empty locations.
- Keep wishlist artwork fully opaque while dimming it.
- Set the Settings window to a fixed height of 700 points.
]]></description>
