            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s New in Discs 4.2.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Build a shuffle queue in Now Playing and browse its selected albums in the carousel.</li>
<li>Search lyrics by song, artist, and album, including combined searches.</li>
<li>Identify instrumental search results and mark selected tracks as instrumental.</li>
<li>Show only the interactive tutorial on first launch until it is completed or skipped.</li>
<li>Includes collection editing, layout, artwork scaling, and navigation improvements.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
