        <item xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle">
            <title>Discs 4.1</title>
            <link>https://github.com/emilianooowo/Discs-Releases/releases/tag/v4.1</link>
            <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 13:14:00 -0600</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s New in Discs 4.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>A simpler Add CD flow for entering the CDs you own.</li>
<li>Find an editable tracklist through iTunes.</li>
<li>Search iTunes for artwork, with clear image limits before importing.</li>
<li>LRCLIB remains available for lyrics.</li>
<li>Removed MusicBrainz, Cover Art Archive, automatic metadata and the separate music-database search.</li>
<li>Simplified legacy backup import while retaining encrypted backups and import safety checks.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
