        <item>
            <title>3.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:07:38 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/emilianooowo/Discs-Releases/releases/tag/v3.4.0</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Discs 3.4.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Edit shared CD fields with clear mixed values and pickers for tags, locations, editions, and imported countries.</li>
<li>See consistent domestic, imported, unknown-country, and unset labels across album details and tables.</li>
<li>Find clearer context-menu actions with system icons, and edit multiple selected albums from the grid or table.</li>
<li>Use simplified Settings, more focused artist, genre, and location tables, and a compact recent listening-history preview.</li>
<li>Search the manual CD picker in Shuffle and use a simpler Now Playing experience.</li>
<li>Removed phrase-based notifications.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
