        <item>
            <title>3.2.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What’s new</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Choose a home country and set a country of origin for each CD. Existing albums stay unchanged unless you edit their country.</li>
                    <li>Sort each location table independently.</li>
                    <li>See the selected album under the Now Playing title and use an improved location selector.</li>
                    <li>Search genres globally and avoid duplicate albums in tag results.</li>
                    <li>Lyrics adapt their contrast to the album background.</li>
                    <li>Library Dates uses native Liquid Glass options.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
